cff-version: 1.2.0
title: OFTY Glaucoma Suite — Verification Repository
abstract: >-
  Verification infrastructure for the OFTY Glaucoma Suite, a deterministic
  rule-based clinical decision support framework for structured glaucoma
  monitoring. Contains the test runner, rule schemas (31 rules across 5
  modules), 23 manual archetypal scenarios, and 192 combinatorial
  configurations used to produce the 215-configuration verification result
  reported in the accompanying methodological paper.
